    {
        "id": 22,
        "raw": "[name=\"Dobermann\"]  To make things worse, Reunion goons might be lurking in every nook and cranny.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Dobermann",
        "content": "To make things worse, Reunion goons might be lurking in every nook and cranny."
    },
    {
        "id": 23,
        "raw": "[name=\"Dobermann\"]  Actually, that's probably too conservative.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Dobermann",
        "content": "Actually, that's probably too conservative."
    },
    {
        "id": 24,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_130_doberm_ex\", name2=\"char_148_nearl_1\", focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_130_doberm_ex.png",
        "name2": "char_148_nearl_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 25,
        "raw": "[name=\"Nearl\"]  What you should've said is that they're probably partying on the streets.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Nearl",
        "content": "What you should've said is that they're probably partying on the streets."
    },
    {
        "id": 26,
        "raw": "[Blocker(a=0, initr=2, r=0, g=0, b=0, fadetime=1, block=true)]",
        "type": "blocker",
        "a": "0,",
        "initr": "2,",
        "r": "0,",
        "g": "0,",
        "b": "0,",
        "fadetime": "1,",
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "id": 27,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_016_medic\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_016_medic.png"
    },
    {
        "id": 28,
        "raw": "[name=\"Medic\"]  Almost every street is filled with destruction, violence and looting. Vehicles and buildings are being set on fire...",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Medic",
        "content": "Almost every street is filled with destruction, violence and looting. Vehicles and buildings are being set on fire..."
    },
    {
        "id": 29,
        "raw": "[name=\"Medic\"]  But these thugs decide that it's the perfect weather for a picnic!",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Medic",
        "content": "But these thugs decide that it's the perfect weather for a picnic!"
    },
    {
        "id": 30,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_148_nearl_1#6\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_148_nearl_1#6.png"
    },
    {
        "id": 31,
        "raw": "[name=\"Nearl\"]  If they're going out on a picnic now, it's the Catastrophe that will feast upon their bones.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Nearl",
        "content": "If they're going out on a picnic now, it's the Catastrophe that will feast upon their bones."
    },
    {
        "id": 32,
        "raw": "[name=\"Nearl\"]  This proves that most Reunion members are just fools who've been whipped into a frenzy.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Nearl",
        "content": "This proves that most Reunion members are just fools who've been whipped into a frenzy."
    },
    {
        "id": 33,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_002_amiya_1#6\", name2=\"char_016_medic\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#6.png",
        "name2": "char_016_medic"
    },
