        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#2.png",
        "name2": "char_016_medic",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 38,
        "raw": "[name=\"Amiya\"]   ...Pfft.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Amiya",
        "content": "...Pfft."
    },
    {
        "id": 39,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_002_amiya_1#2\", name2=\"char_016_medic\", focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#2.png",
        "name2": "char_016_medic",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 40,
        "raw": "[name=\"Medic\"]   Look, they're not really having a picnic...",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Medic",
        "content": "Look, they're not really having a picnic..."
    },
    {
        "id": 41,
        "raw": "[name=\"Medic\"]   I, I just wanted something to moan about. You didn't have to take me so seriously...",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Medic",
        "content": "I, I just wanted something to moan about. You didn't have to take me so seriously..."
    },
    {
        "id": 42,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_148_nearl_1\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_148_nearl_1.png"
    },
    {
        "id": 43,
        "raw": "[name=\"Nearl\"]  ...",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Nearl",
        "content": "..."
    },
    {
        "id": 44,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_148_nearl_1#6\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_148_nearl_1#6.png"
    },
    {
        "id": 45,
        "raw": "[name=\"Nearl\"]  Oh, you weren't being serious？Wait, were you trying to crack a joke?",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Nearl",
        "content": "Oh, you weren't being serious？Wait, were you trying to crack a joke?"
    },
    {
        "id": 46,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_148_nearl_1#2\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_148_nearl_1#2.png"
    },
    {
        "id": 47,
        "raw": "[name=\"Nearl\"]  Hmm...",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Nearl",
        "content": "Hmm..."
    },
    {
        "id": 48,
        "raw": "[name=\"Nearl\"]  Sorry, I'm not good with this stuff...",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Nearl",
        "content": "Sorry, I'm not good with this stuff..."
    },
    {
        "id": 49,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_148_nearl_1#2\", name2=\"char_016_medic\", focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_148_nearl_1#2.png",
        "name2": "char_016_medic",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 50,
        "raw": "[name=\"Medic\"]  Umm... It's fine...",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Medic",
        "content": "Umm... It's fine..."
    },
    {
        "id": 51,
        "raw": "[name=\"Medic\"]  It's just that... trying not to laugh is hard...",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Medic",
        "content": "It's just that... trying not to laugh is hard..."
    },
    {
        "id": 52,
        "raw": "[name=\"Medic\"]  Um, sorry... for trying to make a joke at such a serious time...",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Medic",
        "content": "Um, sorry... for trying to make a joke at such a serious time..."
    },
    {
        "id": 53,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_002_amiya_1#3 \")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#3 .png"
    },
    {
        "id": 54,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_002_amiya_1#1 \")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#1 .png"
    },
    {
        "id": 55,
        "raw": "[name=\"Amiya\"]  It's okay.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Amiya",
        "content": "It's okay."
    },
    {
        "id": 56,
        "raw": "[name=\"Amiya\"]  Rhodes Island wasn't founded for the sake of having everyone keep a serious face.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Amiya",
        "content": "Rhodes Island wasn't founded for the sake of having everyone keep a serious face."
    },
    {
        "id": 57,
        "raw": "[name=\"Amiya\"]  We've always wanted everyone to be able to smile.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Amiya",
        "content": "We've always wanted everyone to be able to smile."
    },
    {
        "id": 58,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_002_amiya_1#1 \",name2=\"char_016_medic\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#1 .png",
        "name2": "char_016_medic",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 59,
        "raw": "[name=\"Medic\"]  A-Amiya...",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Medic",
        "content": "A-Amiya..."
    },
    {
        "id": 60,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_002_amiya_1#1 \",name2=\"char_016_medic\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#1 .png",
        "name2": "char_016_medic",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 61,
        "raw": "[name=\"Amiya\"]  Don't worry about it!",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Amiya",
        "content": "Don't worry about it!"
    },
    {
        "id": 62,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_130_doberm_ex\",name2=\"char_014_riope\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_130_doberm_ex.png",
        "name2": "char_014_riope",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 63,
        "raw": "[name=\"Dobermann\"]  In any case, let's help out with the scouting.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Dobermann",
        "content": "In any case, let's help out with the scouting."
    },
    {
        "id": 64,
        "raw": "[name=\"Dobermann\"]  I'll quietly dispatch the enemy at our four o'clock.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Dobermann",
        "content": "I'll quietly dispatch the enemy at our four o'clock."
    },
    {
        "id": 65,
        "raw": "[name=\"Dobermann\"]  Hopefully their diseased organs won't explode or be rigged to serve as some kind of alarm.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Dobermann",
        "content": "Hopefully their diseased organs won't explode or be rigged to serve as some kind of alarm."
    },
    {
        "id": 66,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_130_doberm_ex\",name2=\"char_014_riope\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_130_doberm_ex.png",
        "name2": "char_014_riope",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 67,
        "raw": "[name=\"Ace\"]  We'll wrap around and take care of the large group on the other side of the fortification.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Ace",
        "content": "We'll wrap around and take care of the large group on the other side of the fortification."
    },
    {
        "id": 68,
        "raw": "[name=\"Ace\"]  With this much chaos around us, nobody will notice a little more noise.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Ace",
        "content": "With this much chaos around us, nobody will notice a little more noise."
    },
